  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Meet Me At The Creek** (2 other sources): This song included a Smells Like Teen Spirit tease and a Tweezer Reprise jam [3][4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-01-30.at853** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 7 songs; 45 min [1]\n- **billystrings2019-01-30.four61ob.flac24**: audience recording; 7 songs; 43 min [2]\n- **bs2019-01-30.ME64**: source not stated; 6 songs; 44 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [3]\n- **bs2019-01-30.ME66**: source not stated; 6 songs; 44 min [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-01-30.at853**: taped by Robbie Cox; transferred by Robbie Cox; source: Audio Technica AT853 cardioids w/ 4.7K mod (DINa, DFC, Behind Board)> Zoom H6 (24/44.1) > SD Card [1]\n- **billystrings2019-01-30.four61ob.flac24**: taped by four61ob; transferred by four61ob; source: AUD > Rode M5(ORTF) > Zoom H5 (24bit/96kHz) > SDHC card [2]. Also: Audience recording made with Rode M5 mics in ORTF configuration into a Zoom H5 at 24-bit/96kHz, saved to SDHC card [2]\n- **bs2019-01-30.ME64**: taped by Greg Nash [3]. Also: Taped with Sennheiser ME64 mics through a custom K6 box into a Sound Devices MixPre3, 24-bit/44.1kHz, placed 8 feet high behind the soundboard; Transferred from SDHC card using Soundforge 10, normalized and converted to 16-bit [3]\n- **bs2019-01-30.ME66**: taped by Greg Nash [4]. Also: Transferred from SDHC card using Soundforge 10, normalized and converted to 16-bit [4]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com: [Billy Strings - 2019-01-30 House of Blues, Boston, MA](https://thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com/2019/05/billy-strings-2019-01-30-house-of-blues.html) [7]",
